<title>INDIA: India announces sale of 50 bln rupee securities.</title>
<headline>India announces sale of 50 bln rupee securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian government on Tuesday announced the sale of dated securities of four year tenure in the form of stocks to the public by auction for a total amount of 50 billion rupees.</p>
<p>A Finance Ministry statement said the auction would be conducted by the Reserve Bank of India on July 28.</p>
<p>&quot;The government stock is eligible for ready forward facility,&quot; the statement said.</p>
</text>
